msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.COLA.NAME"
msgid "Cola"
msgstr "可乐"

msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.COLA.DESC"
msgid "A caffeine-rich carbonated drink. Loaded with sucrose, so you'll need to eat less."
msgstr "一种富含咖啡因的碳酸饮料，充足的蔗糖足矣让你少吃点饭了"

msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.BEVERAGEMIXER.NAME"
msgid "Beverage Mixer"
msgstr "饮料调配机"

msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.BEVERAGEMIXER.DESC"
msgid "A machine that blends liquids, gases and spices in exact proportions."
msgstr "一台把液体、气体和香料按比例混合的机器。"

msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.BEVERAGEMIXER.EFFECT"
msgid "Blends ingredients into assorted beverages."
msgstr "将原料调配成各种饮品。"

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.MODIFIERS.DUPLICANTDRANKCOLA.NAME"
msgid "Drank Cola"
msgstr "喝了可乐"

msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.MODIFIERS.DUPLICANTDRANKCOLA.TOOLTIP"
msgid "A chilled glass of Cola. Stress melts away, spirits lift."
msgstr "一杯冰镇可乐，压力消散，精神百倍。"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.BEVERAGEMIXER.RECIPE_NAME"
msgid "Cola"
msgstr "可乐"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.BEVERAGEMIXER.RECIPE_DESC"
msgid "Water, Carbon Dioxide, Sucrose and Pincha Peppernut, fused under pressure into a glass of Cola."
msgstr "水、二氧化碳、蔗糖和火椒粒在高压下融合成一杯可乐。"

msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.SUPERCAPACITOR.NAME"
msgid "Super Capacitor Bank"
msgstr "超级电容库"

msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.SUPERCAPACITOR.DESC"
msgid "A rack of high-density supercapacitors. It holds far more charge than an ordinary battery and keeps a grid running long after the generators stop."
msgstr "一组高密度超级电容。储电量远超普通电池，即使发电机停摆，也能让电网继续运转很久。"

msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.SUPERCAPACITOR.EFFECT"
msgid "Stores up to <b>800 kJ</b> of Power.\n\nLeaks 50 J per second to internal resistance and emits 50 DTU/s of Heat.\n\nSends a Green Signal when its charge rises above the activation threshold."
msgstr "最多储存 <b>800 千焦</b>电力。\n\n因内阻每秒泄漏 50 焦耳，并产生 50 复制热/秒。\n\n电量高于启动阈值时输出绿色信号。"

msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.SUPERCAPACITOR.LOGIC_PORT"
msgid "Battery Charge"
msgstr "电池电量"

msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.SUPERCAPACITOR.LOGIC_PORT_ACTIVE"
msgid "Sends a <b><style=\"logic_on\">Green Signal</style></b> when the charge rises above the activation threshold"
msgstr "电量高于启动阈值时输出<b><style=\"logic_on\">绿色信号</style></b>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.SUPERCAPACITOR.LOGIC_PORT_INACTIVE"
msgid "Sends a <b><style=\"logic_off\">Red Signal</style></b> when the charge falls below the deactivation threshold"
msgstr "电量低于停止阈值时输出<b><style=\"logic_off\">红色信号</style></b>"

msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SWEETCANE.NAME"
msgid "Sweet Cane"
msgstr "甜蔗"

msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SWEETCANE.DESC"
msgid "A variant of Salty Sticks, with sucrose crystals growing along its stalk. Duplicants adore eating it, but the osmotic pressure from all that sugar leaves them thirsty."
msgstr "咸蔗的变种，茎秆上析出蔗糖晶体。复制人很喜欢吃，但糖分带来的渗透压会导致口渴。"

msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SWEETCANE.DOMESTICATEDDESC"
msgid "This plant has been domesticated and needs irrigation to grow."
msgstr "这种植物经过驯化，需要灌溉才能生长。"

msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SEEDS.SWEETCANE.NAME"
msgid "Sweet Cane Seed"
msgstr "甜蔗种子"

msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SEEDS.SWEETCANE.DESC"
msgid "The seed of a Sweet Cane. Plant it to harvest Sweet Cane."
msgstr "甜蔗的种子。种下后可以收获甜蔗。"

msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SWEETCANE.NAME"
msgid "Sweet Cane"
msgstr "甜蔗"

msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SWEETCANE.DESC"
msgid "A variant of Salty Sticks, its stalk studded with crystallised sucrose. Duplicants love it, but it leaves them thirsty."
msgstr "咸蔗的变种，茎秆上结着析出的蔗糖晶体。复制人很爱吃，但吃完会口渴。"

msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.SWEETCANE.TITLE"
msgid "Sweet Cane"
msgstr "甜蔗"

msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.SWEETCANE.SUBTITLE"
msgid "A variant of Salty Sticks"
msgstr "咸蔗的变种"

msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.SWEETCANE.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid "Sweet Cane is a variant of Salty Sticks. Its stalk bears crystallised sucrose, formed naturally as sugar accumulates between the fibres.\n\nDuplicants are very fond of eating Sweet Cane.\n\nBut Sweet Cane contains far too much sugar, and the osmotic pressure it brings leaves whoever eats it thirsty."
msgstr "甜蔗是咸蔗的变种。它的茎秆上有着析出的蔗糖晶体，那是糖分在纤维间富集之后自然形成的。\n\n复制人很喜欢吃甜蔗。\n\n不过甜蔗的糖分实在太多，食用后带来的渗透压会导致口渴。"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.SWEETCANE_CRUSH.RECIPE_NAME"
msgid "Sucrose and Plant Husk"
msgstr "蔗糖与植物外壳"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.SWEETCANE_CRUSH.RECIPE_DESC"
msgid "Sweet Cane run through the crusher, split into its sugar and its husk."
msgstr "把甜蔗投入碎石机，分离出其中的蔗糖与植物外壳。"

msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.COFFEETREE.NAME"
msgid "Coffee Tree"
msgstr "咖啡树"

msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.COFFEETREE.DESC"
msgid "A close relative of the Pincha Peppernut Vine. Its fruit has lost all of the peppernut's heat, but carries a far higher concentration of caffeine.\n\nIt spends most of its life slowly laying down a woody stem, making it a painfully slow crop to grow, but it asks for nothing except abundant light."
msgstr "火椒藤的近亲。它的果实失去了火椒粒的辛辣，但咖啡因浓度要高得多。\n\n它一生大部分时间都在缓慢地长出木质化的茎，因此生长期长得出奇地煎熬，但它除充足的光照外一无所求。"

msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.COFFEETREE.DOMESTICATEDDESC"
msgid "This plant has been domesticated. It does not need fertiliser, but demands strong light to grow."
msgstr "这株植物已被培育。它不需要施肥，但需要强光才能生长。"

msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SEEDS.COFFEETREE.NAME"
msgid "Coffee Tree Seed"
msgstr "咖啡树种子"

msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SEEDS.COFFEETREE.DESC"
msgid "The seed of a Coffee Tree. Plant it in bright light to harvest Coffee Beans."
msgstr "咖啡树的种子。把它种在光照充足的地方即可收获咖啡豆。"

msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.COFFEEBEAN.NAME"
msgid "Coffee Bean"
msgstr "咖啡豆"

msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.COFFEEBEAN.DESC"
msgid "The roasted seed of a Coffee Tree. It has no flavour worth eating on its own, but brewed properly it will wake a Duplicant right up."
msgstr "咖啡树的烘焙种子。直接吃毫无风味可言，但煮得好的话能让复制人一下子清醒过来。"
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.HARMONYEYE.NAME"
msgid "Eye of Harmony"
msgstr "鸿蒙之眼"

msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.HARMONYEYE.DESC"
msgid "A mysterious device of unknown make. While it is supplied with power, a <b>simulated universe</b> is born at its core.\nThe <b>simulated universe</b> feeds on the neutronium produced by the Time Bow and, given vast amounts of hydrogen, yields matter far in excess of its input mass."
msgstr "一个未知的神秘装置，在电力足矣维系时，其中心将诞生一个<b>模拟宇宙</b>\n<b>模拟宇宙</b>能够基于时间之弓产生的中子质用大量的氢气换出远超输入质量的巨量物质"

msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.HARMONYEYE.EFFECT"
msgid "A monument to something that watched this place before the colony ever existed."
msgstr "献给在殖民地诞生之前就已注视此地的存在的纪念碑。"
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.NEUTRONIUMLIQUIDCONDUIT.NAME"
msgid "Neutronium Liquid Pipe"
msgstr "中子质液体管道"

msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.NEUTRONIUMLIQUIDCONDUIT.DESC"
msgid "A pipe drawn from neutronium. Nothing else survives the pressure it is built to carry."
msgstr "用中子质拉制的管道，没有任何别的材料能承受它设计要承载的压力。"

msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.NEUTRONIUMLIQUIDCONDUIT.EFFECT"
msgid "Carries <b>Liquid</b> between buildings.\n\nHolds up to <b>5 t</b> per segment."
msgstr "在建筑之间输送<b>液体</b>。\n\n每格可容纳 <b>5 吨</b>。"

msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.NEUTRONIUMGASCONDUIT.NAME"
msgid "Neutronium Gas Pipe"
msgstr "中子质气体管道"

msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.NEUTRONIUMGASCONDUIT.DESC"
msgid "A pipe drawn from neutronium. Its walls shrug off the pressure that would burst any other pipe."
msgstr "用中子质拉制的管道，别的管道会被撑爆的压力对它毫无影响。"

msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.NEUTRONIUMGASCONDUIT.EFFECT"
msgid "Carries <b>Gas</b> between buildings.\n\nHolds up to <b>1 t</b> per segment."
msgstr "在建筑之间输送<b>气体</b>。\n\n每格可容纳 <b>1 吨</b>。"

msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.NEUTRONIUMSOLIDCONDUIT.NAME"
msgid "Neutronium Conveyor Rail"
msgstr "中子质运输轨道"

msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.NEUTRONIUMSOLIDCONDUIT.DESC"
msgid "A rail drawn from neutronium. It moves loads that would shear an ordinary conveyor apart."
msgstr "用中子质拉制的轨道，能运送会把普通运输轨道扯断的载荷。"

msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.NEUTRONIUMSOLIDCONDUIT.EFFECT"
msgid "Carries <b>Solid</b> materials between buildings.\n\nMoves objects of up to <b>10 t</b> each."
msgstr "在建筑之间输送<b>固体</b>。\n\n可运送单件重达 <b>10 吨</b> 的物品。"

msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.TIMEBOW.NAME"
msgid "Time Bow"
msgstr "时间之弓"

msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.TIMEBOW.DESC"
msgid "Give time to matter, and it yields immense clean power. Because of an improper operation our \"homeland\" was blasted apart; for safety, it refuses to work unless helium is fed in, and while working it produces a special substance - neutronium."
msgstr "给时间以物质，生产出大量的清洁能源。因为不当操作，我们的“故乡”已被炸毁；为了安全，必须输入氦气才允许工作，工作时会产出特殊物质——中子质。"

msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.TIMEBOW.EFFECT"
msgid "Generates <b>800 W</b> of Power.\n\nConsumes <b>30 kg</b> of <b>Helium</b> per cycle.\n\nProduces <b>500 kg</b> of <b>Neutronium</b> per cycle from its right edge.\n\nEmits no heat."
msgstr "产生 <b>800 瓦</b>电力。\n\n每周期消耗 <b>30 千克</b> <b>氦气</b>。\n\n每周期从右边缘产出 <b>500 千克</b> <b>中子质</b>。\n\n不产生热量。"

msgctxt "STRINGS.RESEARCH.TECHS.PASSIVEENERGY.NAME"
msgid "Passive Energy"
msgstr "无源能源"

msgctxt "STRINGS.RESEARCH.TECHS.PASSIVEENERGY.DESC"
msgid "Draw power out of processes that were never meant to be harnessed. Nothing burns, nothing decays - the current simply arrives."
msgstr "从本不该被利用的过程里取电。没有燃烧，没有衰变——电流自己流出来。"

msgctxt "STRINGS.RESEARCH.TECHS.POCKETUNIVERSE.NAME"
msgid "Pocket Universe"
msgstr "口袋宇宙"

msgctxt "STRINGS.RESEARCH.TECHS.POCKETUNIVERSE.DESC"
msgid "Fold a universe small enough to fit inside a machine. Feeding it matter is optional; feeding it neutronium is not."
msgstr "把一个宇宙折叠到能塞进机器里。喂它物质是可选的，喂它中子质不是。"

msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.SMARTCHILLER.NAME"
msgid "Smart Liquid Chiller"
msgstr "智能液冷机"

msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.SMARTCHILLER.DESC"
msgid "A chiller that reads a number and obeys it. Set the temperature you want coming out, and it holds your coolant there - chilling whatever arrives too warm, and waving through whatever is already cold enough."
msgstr "一台会读数的液冷机。把想要流出的温度写给它，它就把你的冷却液稳定在那儿——进来太热的降温，本来够冷的直接放行。"

msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.SMARTCHILLER.EFFECT"
msgid "Cools <b>Liquid</b> down to the <b>target temperature</b> shown on its display.\n\nConsumes <b>1800 W</b> of Power while chilling.\n\nLiquid that is already at or below the target passes through untouched, using no power.\n\nHeat removed from the liquid is dumped into the building itself."
msgstr "把<b>液体</b>冷却到屏幕上设定的<b>目标温度</b>。\n\n冷却时消耗 <b>1800 瓦</b>电力。\n\n已经低于目标温度的液体直接通过，不降温也不耗电。\n\n从液体里抽走的热量会灌进建筑自身。"